.TH SDL_AssertBreakpoint 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_AssertBreakpoint \- The macro used when an assertion triggers a breakpoint.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_assert.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_AssertBreakpoint() SDL_TriggerBreakpoint()
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This isn\(aqt for direct use by apps; use
.BR SDL_assert
or
.BR SDL_TriggerBreakpoint
instead\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This macro is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

